From 88a51687433962b4e180134ee53c1de33d1d8418 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VPK <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:48:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 48/50] 0048: VPVulkan MSAA memoryless: todo attachment no
 persistente (VPVK_MSAA_TILE), memoria LAZILY_ALLOCATED sin RAM, gpu.mem_tex
 (upstream ced6226, fb5829a, 662a70b, 9f5867b); tests. Requiere 0049 (metal2
 MemStats) para compilar en visionOS

---
